=== M5c: CORRECTION to the 'restored copy reads again' line above ===
That line was NOT a positive control: M4 removed build.devUrl and M5 only
restored the FILE, so the copy was still mutated and failed for the M4
reason. The key is restored here; this is the real control.
--- M5c-1: copy with a valid config, nothing listening:
desktop: pid=- alive=no health=down url=http://127.0.0.1:5174
exit=1
--- M5c-2: copy with a valid config and the simulated server up:
cargo tauri dev started: pid=45147 log=.runtime/desktop.log
dev server answering: http://127.0.0.1:5174
exit=0
desktop: pid=45147 alive=yes health=ok url=http://127.0.0.1:5174
exit=0
cargo tauri dev stopped
exit=0
=> with the same file and only build.devUrl varying (M3 vs M5c-2), health
   flips; with the same config and only the server varying (M1 vs M5c-1
   vs M5c-2), health flips. Both digits are readings, not constants.
